# === Run-directory policy ======================================
# Templates are complete tracked copies, including empty destinations.
!studies_run_templates/**/logs/
!studies_run_templates/**/logs/.gitkeep
!studies_run_templates/**/locks/dist/
!studies_run_templates/**/locks/dist/.gitkeep
# Promoted runs may intentionally retain the experiment package artifacts.
!studies_runs/haiu_comparison/git_tracked/**/locks/dist/
!studies_runs/haiu_comparison/git_tracked/**/locks/dist/**

# === Windows ===================================================
~$*
*Zone.Identifier
